          <path class="lead" d="M300 96 L352 76" /><text class="t" x="358" y="74">DBS lead</text><text class="s" x="358" y="92">4 ring contacts</text>
        </svg></div>
        <div class="sheet"><svg viewBox="0 0 600 420" role="img" aria-label="Closed loop: STN local field potential beta power is estimated, a patient model sets stimulation amplitude, and the effect is measured again. A small plot shows amplitude rising when beta crosses a threshold.">
