        </svg></div>
      </div>

      <figcaption class="mono">Drawings are schematic. The 3D model above is group-average anatomy in MNI152 space (HCP S1200 cortex, HCP-MMP1.0 area 4, HCP subcortical atlas); the STN is placed at approximate literature coordinates. Device geometry is representative, not a surgical plan.</figcaption>
    </figure>

    <div class="basis">
      <p class="mono">Research basis</p>
      <div>
        <a href="https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-08993-1" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Ko et al., Nature 2025 · DG→CA3→CA1 engram circuitry reorganizes over time ↗</a>
